# You open the door to the landlady, looking for Min-jun. "friend" is a buried clue (pin).
# Saying you're his friend is a lie that works. She doesn't catch your name the first time.
# Each <id>-alt<n> is a written wrong reply, using only words met by then; <id>-alt<n>-answer is the answer to it.

call = 민준 씨? 민준 씨!
call-reply = 네?

mistaken = 민준 씨?
mistaken-reply = 아니요.
mistaken-alt1 = 네, 민준 씨.
mistaken-alt1-answer = 네? 아니요, 아니요!
mistaken-alt2 = 민준 씨?

friend = 민준 씨 친구예요?
friend-reply = 아니요.
friend-alt1 = 친구예요.
friend-alt1-answer = 친구……
friend-alt2 = 민준 씨?

who = 누구세요?
who-reply = { $player }입니다.
who-alt1 = 민준입니다.
who-alt1-answer = 민준? 아니요!
who-alt2 = 민준 씨 친구예요?

name = 네? 누구예요?
name-reply = 저는 { $player }입니다.
name-alt1 = 저는 민준입니다.
name-alt1-answer = 민준? 아니요!
name-alt2 = 누구세요?

missing = 민준 씨 어디예요?
missing-reply = 몰라요.
missing-alt1 = 민준 씨 친구예요.
missing-alt2 = 누구예요?

bye = 네…… 안녕히 계세요.
bye-reply = 네.
bye-alt1 = 민준 씨?
bye-alt2 = 누구예요?
